  "description": "Lightweight in-memory recurring background jobs for .NET: interval, fixed-rate (drop-on-overlap), and cron schedules that run on every instance of your app, without Redis or any other backend. Built-in jitter to desynchronize replicas, run-on-startup control, execution timeouts, and live enable/disable. AOT-friendly via bundled source generator. The per-replica counterpart to SingletonJob.",
